@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
' or:
scale 2
' or:
scale max 2000 width
title 02. Cash Top-up at an Authorized Counter

|Student|
start
:Go to the top-up counter;\nProvide student ID / wallet QR;
:Hand over cash;

|Accountant / Counter Clerk|
:Count the cash;\nEnter the amount & payer information;
:Select "Confirm cash top-up";

|System|
:Verify staff permissions;\nCheck wallet exists & wallet status;
if (Valid?) then (Yes)
  :Credit wallet balance;
  :Create cash top-up transaction\n(refId, timestamp, channel=CASH);
  :Write audit log;
  :Return success result;
else (No)
  :Return error (insufficient permission /\ninvalid wallet);
endif

|Accountant / Counter Clerk|
:Print/display receipt;\nHand receipt to the student;

|Student|
stop
@enduml
